  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      143.47,
      278.47,
      455.52,
      307.82
    ],
    "text": "This Bill amends section 2A of the Principal Enactment so as to ensure that any Ordermade by the Minister thereunder will come into force only upon the approval thereof byParliament.",
